--- !u!114 &7882153830560901098
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 8071843590566777840}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: b1f6bbd4645fe074a84d19b212381cff, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  textBoxes:
  - TextboxContent: Welcome to the Equipment Menu! Here you can equip new artifacts
      and spells that will make your journey though wayward woods easier!
    FontSize: 32
    HorizontalSize: 700
    VerticleSize: 200
    TextboxLocation: {x: 0, y: 0}
    GoToNextTextbox: 0
  - TextboxContent: "First let\u2019s take a look at the spells at your disposal.
      This is your Lightning spell section. Click and drag Thunder Shock into the
      open spell slot"
    FontSize: 32
    HorizontalSize: 700
    VerticleSize: 200
    TextboxLocation: {x: 0, y: 0}
    GoToNextTextbox: 0
  - TextboxContent: "Great! Let\u2019s look at the wind spells next"
    FontSize: 32
    HorizontalSize: 700
    VerticleSize: 50
    TextboxLocation: {x: 0, y: 0}
    GoToNextTextbox: 0
  - TextboxContent: Take Gale Barricade and KnockBack Wind!
    FontSize: 32
    HorizontalSize: 700
    VerticleSize: 100
    TextboxLocation: {x: 0, y: 0}
    GoToNextTextbox: 0
  - TextboxContent: Next, let's take a look at your artifacts. Click on this tag
      to see all of them
    FontSize: 32
    HorizontalSize: 700
    VerticleSize: 100
    TextboxLocation: {x: 0, y: 0}
    GoToNextTextbox: 0
  - TextboxContent: Click and drag an artifact to the open spot
    FontSize: 32
    HorizontalSize: 700
    VerticleSize: 100
    TextboxLocation: {x: 0, y: 0}
    GoToNextTextbox: 0
  - TextboxContent: "Excellent!!! Let\u2019s start the journey! "
    FontSize: 32
    HorizontalSize: 700
    VerticleSize: 50
    TextboxLocation: {x: 0, y: 0}
    GoToNextTextbox: 0
  - TextboxContent: "In order to move, press the \u201CMove\u201D tag in this corner
      and then use W/A/S/D in order to make a path. You have six squares at your
      disposal. When you are done press confirm"
    FontSize: 32
    HorizontalSize: 700
    VerticleSize: 250
    TextboxLocation: {x: 0, y: 0}
    GoToNextTextbox: 0
  - TextboxContent: Choose wisely since you can move only ONCE per turn
    FontSize: 32
    HorizontalSize: 700
    VerticleSize: 100
    TextboxLocation: {x: 0, y: 0}
    GoToNextTextbox: 0
  - TextboxContent: While moving try to collect pips(Pink floating orbs) in your
      way. They will let you cast more spells per turn. But remember you can only
      have a max of six
    FontSize: 32
    HorizontalSize: 700
    VerticleSize: 250
    TextboxLocation: {x: 0, y: 0}
    GoToNextTextbox: 0
  - TextboxContent: At the beginning of each turn you restore one pip
    FontSize: 32
    HorizontalSize: 700
    VerticleSize: 100
    TextboxLocation: {x: 0, y: 0}
    GoToNextTextbox: 0
  - TextboxContent: Now pick Knockback Wind and click on the Racoon in your range
    FontSize: 32
    HorizontalSize: 700
    VerticleSize: 100
    TextboxLocation: {x: 0, y: 0}
    GoToNextTextbox: 0
  - TextboxContent: You can end your turn by pressing this tag
    FontSize: 32
    HorizontalSize: 700
    VerticleSize: 100
    TextboxLocation: {x: 0, y: 0}
    GoToNextTextbox: 0
  - TextboxContent: "Let\u2019s move up to the water to finish off the last foe!"
    FontSize: 32
    HorizontalSize: 700
    VerticleSize: 100
    TextboxLocation: {x: 0, y: 0}
    GoToNextTextbox: 0
  - TextboxContent: Tree stumps around the map block your path, and prevent you from
      casting spells through them. They can also protect you from enemy attacks
    FontSize: 32
    HorizontalSize: 700
    VerticleSize: 200
    TextboxLocation: {x: 0, y: 0}
    GoToNextTextbox: 0
  - TextboxContent: Target the enemy in the water with Thunder Shock and see what
      happens!
    FontSize: 32
    HorizontalSize: 700
    VerticleSize: 100
    TextboxLocation: {x: 0, y: 0}
    GoToNextTextbox: 0
  - TextboxContent: Electrifying! Now use Gale Barricade to prevent them from getting
      to you
    FontSize: 32
    HorizontalSize: 700
    VerticleSize: 100
    TextboxLocation: {x: 0, y: 0}
    GoToNextTextbox: 0
  - TextboxContent: End your turn
    FontSize: 32
    HorizontalSize: 700
    VerticleSize: 50
    TextboxLocation: {x: 0, y: 0}
    GoToNextTextbox: 0
  - TextboxContent: Finish them off now
    FontSize: 32
    HorizontalSize: 700
    VerticleSize: 50
    TextboxLocation: {x: 0, y: 0}
    GoToNextTextbox: 0
  - TextboxContent: Congratulations on the flawless win wizard!
    FontSize: 32
    HorizontalSize: 700
    VerticleSize: 100
    TextboxLocation: {x: 0, y: 0}
    GoToNextTextbox: 0
  textSpeed: 0.1
  autoTextLingerTime: 1
  textBoxTestingIndex: 0
  textBoxImage: {fileID: 5191163656407825873}
  textBoxText: {fileID: 1004568589115182399}
